[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; The one variable: a `.woff2` `default_font`. No Brotli decoder runs in the webview, so sfntTables.ts
; returns null and ascent and descent come from TextMetrics at a 1000px reference size, not the
; head/hhea read the `.otf` sibling covers. The typeface differs, so Godot arbitrates it directly:
; columns exact, rows within 1 px.

